WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.110
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.380 --> 00:07.100
[The content, events, techniques, and outcomes of massage depicted in this series]

3
00:07.210 --> 00:08.211
[are entirely fictional and intended for entertainment purposes only.]

4
00:08.240 --> 00:09.421
[They should not be used as medical advice or as a reference for traditional Thai massage.]

5
00:09.500 --> 00:10.901
[Viewer discretion is advised. Do not attempt to imitate any of the techniques shown,]

6
00:11.000 --> 00:12.001
[as doing so may result in injury.]

7
00:12.030 --> 00:13.161
[Massage services should only be provided by practitioners]

8
00:13.170 --> 00:14.900
[who are legally licensed and registered.]

9
00:14.910 --> 00:16.800
Give up on getting revenge on Dongyang.

10
00:16.928 --> 00:19.640
Once you kill someone, you'll never sleep soundly again.

11
00:19.728 --> 00:21.829
What kind of security is this? How could you let this happen?

12
00:21.900 --> 00:23.200
That massage therapist, Hattha, snuck onto the boat.

13
00:23.219 --> 00:24.718
Why would she want to hurt Mr. Dongyang?

14
00:24.771 --> 00:27.120
She's the daughter of that massage therapist in Phuket.

15
00:27.192 --> 00:28.640
She tried to kill me.

16
00:28.830 --> 00:29.831
Phuket?

17
00:30.206 --> 00:31.407
Master Tim is on his way.

18
00:32.515 --> 00:34.840
Ram them. Keep your head down. Trust me.

19
00:35.907 --> 00:37.308
Watch out! Move!

20
00:41.240 --> 00:42.320
I told you to shoot the tires!

21
00:43.038 --> 00:46.715
She must've used the deadly massage technique.

22
00:46.854 --> 00:48.283
You went all the way there and found them.

23
00:48.331 --> 00:49.720
How could you just let them go?

24
00:50.070 --> 00:52.071
Are you going to wait until she tries to kill me again?

25
00:52.176 --> 00:54.040
I have something important to discuss with them.

26
00:54.224 --> 00:56.560
Using the art of healing massage to kill people...

27
00:56.726 --> 00:58.480
the consequences will come back to haunt you.

28
00:58.507 --> 01:00.360
And you'll become the very kind of person you hate.

29
02:20.606 --> 02:21.607
Hey.

30
02:22.515 --> 02:24.760
- What's this? - He sent it to Mr. Dongyang.

31
02:25.992 --> 02:26.993
You should find something to eat.

32
02:27.880 --> 02:28.881
I can watch him.

33
02:30.360 --> 02:32.100
Got it. Hey, let's go.

34
02:47.211 --> 02:48.212
This is from him.

35
02:49.944 --> 02:50.945
I'm glad you're here.

36
02:52.200 --> 02:54.200
Did you find that bitch Hattha?

37
02:57.272 --> 02:58.273
Not yet.

38
02:58.920 --> 03:00.560
If you find her, don't take her to Master Tim.

39
03:01.646 --> 03:02.920
Bring her to me alive.

40
03:04.840 --> 03:07.801
I'll chop off her arms and legs

41
03:07.843 --> 03:09.100
and let her die a slow death.

42
03:10.939 --> 03:11.960
Give me my phone.

43
03:12.560 --> 03:15.600
I'll call Ching and have him capture that bitch right now.

44
03:23.848 --> 03:25.920
Hey, asshole! What are you doing?

45
04:58.464 --> 04:59.465
He's dead.

46
05:00.731 --> 05:02.120
Go home to your father.

47
05:24.100 --> 05:25.101
Go on.

48
05:27.064 --> 05:28.065
What?

49
05:28.078 --> 05:30.072
- Hurry up! - What are you doing?

50
05:32.880 --> 05:33.881
Phat?

51
05:37.640 --> 05:38.641
Phat.

52
05:44.379 --> 05:46.960
Is this Mr. Wasan's room?

53
05:47.131 --> 05:49.760
No, it's Mr. Pipat's room.

54
05:56.678 --> 05:58.440
Didn't they say you were covering for them?

55
05:58.843 --> 06:01.115
Mr. Dongyang woke up and asked me to get him some coffee.

56
06:02.600 --> 06:03.601
But he's gone back to sleep now.

57
06:25.838 --> 06:26.960
Hurry up!

58
06:34.571 --> 06:35.572
Whose flowers are those?

59
06:36.054 --> 06:37.120
Phat brought them.

60
06:39.256 --> 06:40.257
Boss?

61
06:42.731 --> 06:43.732
Boss?

62
06:50.011 --> 06:51.012
Boss?

63
06:51.370 --> 06:53.000
Mr. Yang? Boss!

64
07:03.459 --> 07:05.606
Nurses' station. How can I help you?

65
07:05.712 --> 07:07.080
Help! My boss isn't breathing!

66
07:07.150 --> 07:08.151
Okay! Okay!

67
07:16.920 --> 07:19.560
Are you his family? Please wait outside. This way.

68
07:20.120 --> 07:22.440
- Please wait outside. This way, please. - Boss!

69
07:23.752 --> 07:24.753
This way.

70
07:29.968 --> 07:30.969
Phat!

71
07:55.110 --> 07:57.320
Go check the security footage and call me.

72
08:07.520 --> 08:09.240
And you, check the fire escape.

73
08:37.907 --> 08:39.008
Hey, wait!

74
08:39.230 --> 08:40.320
You'll scare everyone!

75
08:41.992 --> 08:42.993
Hey, stop!

76
08:54.720 --> 08:56.160
No! Don't!

77
09:00.555 --> 09:01.556
One...

78
09:01.840 --> 09:02.841
Two...

79
09:03.200 --> 09:04.201
Three...

80
09:04.801 --> 09:05.802
Four...

81
09:06.240 --> 09:07.241
Five...

82
09:13.068 --> 09:14.069
Six...

83
09:14.169 --> 09:15.170
Fourteen...

84
09:15.955 --> 09:16.956
Fifteen...

85
09:21.104 --> 09:22.400
Hurry up!

86
09:22.566 --> 09:23.567
Hurry!

87
09:37.567 --> 09:39.600
- Hey, stop! - Hey, stop!

88
09:40.787 --> 09:42.200
- Go! Hurry! - Goddammit!

89
09:45.630 --> 09:48.131
You guys! Those two are heading for the hospital's front entrance!

90
09:49.320 --> 09:50.321
Let's go!

91
10:07.894 --> 10:09.200
There's no one here, Master.

92
10:10.584 --> 10:12.040
There's no one upstairs either.

93
10:26.302 --> 10:27.303
Let's go to the hospital.

94
10:31.080 --> 10:32.320
Phat attacked Mr. Dongyang.

95
10:32.478 --> 10:33.920
And he helped that bitch Hattha escape.

96
10:34.254 --> 10:36.963
That woman also pressed some spot on this guy and knocked him out.

97
10:37.827 --> 10:38.828
She knocked him out by pressing a spot?

98
10:43.307 --> 10:45.320
Where? Where did she press?

99
10:45.694 --> 10:47.880
- Let me see. Hold still. - It hurts, Master!

100
10:47.923 --> 10:49.200
- Ouch! That hurts! - Hold still!

101
10:54.718 --> 10:56.170
Mr. Dongyang has passed away.

102
10:57.480 --> 10:58.840
I'm very sorry for your loss.

103
11:06.259 --> 11:08.000
That bastard Phat! That bitch Hattha!

104
11:08.771 --> 11:09.840
You guys, follow me!

105
11:10.600 --> 11:11.601
No need.

106
11:13.662 --> 11:15.200
Don't waste your energy hunting them down.

107
11:15.576 --> 11:17.160
I'll make them come to me.

108
11:18.080 --> 11:19.120
How are you going to do that, Master?

109
11:30.632 --> 11:31.720
Why did you kill Dongyang?

110
11:33.128 --> 11:35.803
Go back to your father, and don't ever go back there.

111
11:36.040 --> 11:37.160
You think I'm supposed to be grateful?

112
11:37.736 --> 11:39.700
Do you know how much I've had to endure?

113
11:39.710 --> 11:42.200
How hard I've trained just so I could kill him with my own hands?

114
11:44.952 --> 11:45.953
Who hired you?

115
11:46.243 --> 11:47.244
No one.

116
11:47.582 --> 11:49.614
I told you, I don't want you to end up like me.

117
11:50.574 --> 11:51.720
Dongyang is dead.

118
11:51.992 --> 11:53.450
- It's over. - No, it's not.

119
11:54.536 --> 11:55.537
Why did you do that?

120
11:56.648 --> 11:57.800
Who hired you?

121
12:00.958 --> 12:01.992
- Give it to me. - No.

122
12:02.500 --> 12:04.240
- Tell me who hired you? - No one.

123
12:05.411 --> 12:06.411
Give me back my helmet.

124
12:17.011 --> 12:18.819
Where have you been?

125
12:22.880 --> 12:25.200
You still have people who love you and are worried about you.

126
12:26.043 --> 12:27.920
Don't put them through any more trouble.

127
12:28.230 --> 12:29.280
Including you, right?

128
12:29.830 --> 12:32.027
You killed Dongyang. They'll never let you get away with it.

129
12:53.080 --> 12:54.081
Phat.

130
12:55.835 --> 12:56.836
Hey.

131
12:57.286 --> 12:58.287
Come on, let's go home.

132
13:27.515 --> 13:28.600
I killed Dongyang.

133
13:29.024 --> 13:30.125
He's dead, Dad.

134
13:34.059 --> 13:35.320
What the hell have you done?

135
13:36.230 --> 13:37.360
I told you to keep an eye on him,

136
13:37.936 --> 13:39.100
not kill him!

137
14:20.960 --> 14:22.320
Was it this guy, one of Dongyang's men,

138
14:23.312 --> 14:25.240
who texted you that night

139
14:25.891 --> 14:27.400
to warn you that Master Tim was coming to our house?

140
14:30.400 --> 14:32.120
And he even killed Dongyang for you.

141
14:33.928 --> 14:35.100
I think he likes you.

142
14:38.000 --> 14:39.120
Do you like him too?

143
14:40.091 --> 14:42.840
You were with him last night when you disappeared, weren't you?

144
14:43.270 --> 14:45.040
No! It's not what you all think!

145
14:45.060 --> 14:46.100
Nothing happened between us.

146
14:47.238 --> 14:48.640
I haven't even thought about him that way.

147
14:48.939 --> 14:50.280
You're the one thinking about it!

148
14:51.840 --> 14:53.560
- But he's pretty handsome. - Minkheng.

149
14:54.256 --> 14:55.560
- And he's good at what he does, too. - Minkheng!

150
14:56.115 --> 14:57.960
He even broke in and killed Dongyang.

151
14:58.099 --> 14:59.100
Will you stop already?

152
15:00.568 --> 15:01.742
But I agree with him.

153
15:02.462 --> 15:03.600
You shouldn't go back there.

154
15:04.526 --> 15:05.570
There's still that flatfooted bastard.

155
15:05.600 --> 15:07.201
You're still going on about that flatfooted guy?

156
15:08.603 --> 15:09.744
Dongyang's death

157
15:10.320 --> 15:11.440
is a big deal, you know.

158
15:11.952 --> 15:14.438
His men are probably already looking for whoever killed him.

159
15:15.136 --> 15:17.080
Not to mention his business partners.

160
15:17.550 --> 15:20.158
Don't worry, Dad. I'm following Arokaya Land's page.

161
15:20.731 --> 15:21.891
If anything happens, they'll post an update.

162
15:22.931 --> 15:26.640
Thank you to everyone who's sent me messages out of concern.

163
15:27.195 --> 15:28.840
I'm Dongyang, and I'm alive and well.

164
15:31.792 --> 15:34.120
As they say, good people like me

165
15:34.395 --> 15:36.840
always come out of trouble unscathed.

166
15:39.710 --> 15:40.840
Dongyang's still alive!

167
15:41.384 --> 15:42.640
What's going on, kiddo?

168
15:42.691 --> 15:44.180
I saw him die with my own eyes!

169
15:52.300 --> 15:54.301
[Hattha]

170
15:59.963 --> 16:01.920
Hello? Did you see Dongyang's livestream?

171
16:03.099 --> 16:04.160
How is that even possible?

172
16:04.320 --> 16:06.121
I saw you kill him myself.

173
16:06.747 --> 16:07.748
I'll go check it out.

174
16:08.120 --> 16:09.240
You be careful, okay?

175
16:10.096 --> 16:12.397
If he's really alive, he'll be furious with both of us.

176
16:12.848 --> 16:13.849
I have to go.

177
16:13.936 --> 16:14.937
Wait.

178
16:15.552 --> 16:16.640
Something doesn't seem right.

179
16:17.488 --> 16:19.120
Dongyang was still in the hospital this morning.

180
16:19.159 --> 16:21.160
So how is he livestreaming from Arokaya Land now?

181
16:21.544 --> 16:23.600
He doesn't even look injured. He looks way too normal.

182
16:26.323 --> 16:27.324
Be careful.

183
16:47.560 --> 16:48.561
Minkheng.

184
16:48.620 --> 16:50.360
Give Dad his medicine. I'll take care of this.

185
16:50.400 --> 16:51.401
Okay.

186
16:56.342 --> 16:58.240
If you're going to ask me to convince Uncle to let you go back,

187
16:59.000 --> 17:00.001
don't bother.

188
17:00.939 --> 17:03.115
I just want to make sure he's really dead.

189
17:03.579 --> 17:04.880
Then I'll come straight back. I promise.

190
17:05.334 --> 17:06.335
Go talk to your dad yourself.

191
17:07.083 --> 17:08.084
Wan.

192
17:10.680 --> 17:12.979
You keep thinking about avenging someone who's already dead.

193
17:14.051 --> 17:15.326
Don't you ever think about the people who are still alive?

194
17:18.200 --> 17:19.720
Do you know how worried your dad was

195
17:20.240 --> 17:21.547
when you disappeared last night?

196
17:22.011 --> 17:23.387
He couldn't eat or sleep at all.

197
17:24.347 --> 17:25.348
What about me?

198
17:26.662 --> 17:27.880
I can't sleep either.

199
17:29.400 --> 17:32.118
Every time I close my eyes, I still see Mom and P'Phak being killed by those people.

200
17:34.401 --> 17:36.363
Just because we're ordinary people

201
17:37.100 --> 17:38.395
doesn't mean we have to give in to them, does it?

202
17:40.302 --> 17:41.603
But you're all alone.

203
17:41.670 --> 17:43.840
- So what? - What can you possibly do on your own?

204
17:44.334 --> 17:46.000
Are you going to take revenge on everyone who's hurt us?

205
17:46.691 --> 17:49.480
Even if you get rid of one, there'll always be another bad guy.

206
17:51.779 --> 17:53.550
Are you going to keep Uncle waiting and worrying,

207
17:53.678 --> 17:55.912
without even noticing how much older he's getting?

208
17:57.230 --> 17:58.231
Do you realize

209
17:58.755 --> 18:00.960
he might only have months, years, or days left with you?

210
18:07.504 --> 18:08.880
Is there something wrong with Dad that I don't know about?

211
18:12.000 --> 18:14.907
No. Korn is still healthy.

212
18:17.131 --> 18:19.014
But if you keep seeking revenge,

213
18:20.059 --> 18:23.060
one day, Uncle will get dragged into this too.

214
18:24.486 --> 18:26.500
I don't want you to end up regretting it.

215
19:08.683 --> 19:10.470
Maintenance! Come take a look over here!

216
19:12.900 --> 19:13.901
Maintenance!

217
19:15.880 --> 19:16.881
Maintenance!

218
19:17.248 --> 19:18.249
Phat!

219
19:30.526 --> 19:32.800
The VIP guests are getting really angry. Is the food ready yet?

220
19:32.939 --> 19:34.160
The food's on its way.

221
20:03.094 --> 20:04.790
- Which floor? - The VIP floor.

222
20:20.563 --> 20:21.564
Sorry.

223
20:52.542 --> 20:53.543
Put it over there.

224
20:58.220 --> 20:59.520
Phat hasn't shown up yet, Master.

225
21:00.462 --> 21:01.463
He'll come.

226
21:02.494 --> 21:03.640
He has no choice but to come.

227
21:08.339 --> 21:10.280
Desmond wants to video call the VIP.

228
21:12.584 --> 21:13.585
Sure.

229
21:14.371 --> 21:15.372
Go ahead.

230
21:15.704 --> 21:16.705
Yes, sir.

231
21:51.822 --> 21:53.680
Hi. What's up Desmond?

232
21:54.195 --> 21:57.760
I heard you're sick. Is everything okay, Dongyang?

233
21:58.605 --> 21:59.920
Yeah, I'm alright.

234
22:00.704 --> 22:04.440
Come on, man. Don't forget who I am.

235
22:05.560 --> 22:06.561
Don't worry.

236
22:06.854 --> 22:08.800
Everything is still the same.

237
22:09.275 --> 22:10.496
I'm glad to hear that.

238
22:10.720 --> 22:13.440
If you weren't here, I didn't trust anyone else.

239
22:41.647 --> 22:42.840
What's wrong with Master Tim's feet, Dad?

240
22:43.307 --> 22:44.408
You're still on about that?

241
22:44.900 --> 22:46.401
Stay away from Master Tim.

242
22:49.595 --> 22:50.800
I was just asking.

243
22:52.795 --> 22:53.880
I'm serious.

244
22:55.403 --> 22:57.404
Master Tim is not someone you should mess with.

245
22:58.827 --> 22:59.963
Stay away from him.

246
23:35.726 --> 23:37.680
I'm going to Bangkok to make a delivery.

247
23:38.102 --> 23:39.760
I'll stop by the house to pick up some things, too.

248
23:40.070 --> 23:41.560
- Do you need anything? - I'm coming with you.

249
23:44.934 --> 23:46.300
It's dangerous for Wan to go alone.

250
23:48.507 --> 23:49.520
Really, Dad.

251
23:50.310 --> 23:51.311
Are you sure?

252
23:57.500 --> 23:58.560
Then hurry back.

253
24:01.971 --> 24:03.300
Take care of her, okay?

254
24:03.987 --> 24:04.988
Yes, Dad.

255
24:16.216 --> 24:17.960
You can go get it, Wan. I'll keep watch.

256
24:18.302 --> 24:19.925
Keep watch for what? No need.

257
24:20.110 --> 24:21.111
We're going together.

258
25:04.288 --> 25:05.880
They've returned to the house in Talat Phlu.

259
25:26.870 --> 25:27.871
I'll take care of it myself.

260
25:39.771 --> 25:41.600
- Muk?- - Master Tim wants to talk to you two.

261
25:42.070 --> 25:44.352
What's it about? I have somewhere I need to be.

262
25:45.112 --> 25:46.504
Master Tim wants to see both of you.

263
25:47.406 --> 25:48.520
Especially Hattha.

264
25:51.198 --> 25:52.199
Come on.

265
25:54.056 --> 25:56.080
Please come with us nicely. Don't make us force you.

266
25:56.080 --> 25:59.446
You know what Master Tim wants to talk to my sister about, don't you?

267
26:02.100 --> 26:03.301
Those bruises on your neck...

268
26:04.571 --> 26:05.600
Master Tim did that to you, didn't he?

269
26:09.824 --> 26:11.360
Why would he hurt you like that?

270
26:13.100 --> 26:14.160
Are you hurt anywhere else?

271
26:15.854 --> 26:17.680
- Let's hurry up and go. - Muk!

272
26:19.608 --> 26:21.043
I told you to stay in the car.

273
26:22.609 --> 26:23.610
Watch out!

274
26:28.050 --> 26:29.520
Get in the car!

275
26:31.051 --> 26:32.052
Hey.

276
26:32.640 --> 26:34.520
If you don't run now, I won't be able to help you anymore.

277
26:36.286 --> 26:37.287
Phat, you bastard!

278
26:37.875 --> 26:39.080
Hey! Open up!

279
26:42.483 --> 26:43.484
Thank you.

280
26:58.752 --> 27:00.960
I'm glad to be doing business with you, Master Tim.

281
27:01.659 --> 27:03.768
You're much easier to deal with than Dongyang.

282
27:04.856 --> 27:05.857
What are you going to do with Phat?

283
27:07.219 --> 27:09.880
My men who know what happened are really upset.

284
27:12.270 --> 27:15.200
I'll take care of him myself, don't worry.

285
27:15.315 --> 27:16.800
Well, I'd better get going.

286
27:24.120 --> 27:25.121
[Muk]

287
27:25.928 --> 27:27.760
Have you got them?

288
27:46.646 --> 27:47.647
What?

289
27:48.182 --> 27:49.760
I knew something was off during the livestream.

290
27:51.000 --> 27:52.640
Master Tim used a Deepfake to fool everyone.

291
27:55.667 --> 27:56.668
So that means...

292
27:57.886 --> 27:59.160
Dongyang really is dead?

293
27:59.448 --> 28:00.449
Yeah.

294
28:01.272 --> 28:03.320
And they probably know I killed him.

295
28:05.552 --> 28:06.553
But don't worry.

296
28:07.760 --> 28:09.100
Dongyang's men don't know about this place.

297
28:13.387 --> 28:14.960
Then why are you getting a gun ready?

298
28:17.694 --> 28:18.695
Just in case.

299
28:29.016 --> 28:30.017
[Dad]

300
28:32.830 --> 28:33.831
Hello?

301
28:34.904 --> 28:36.840
Dad, calm down. Calm down.

302
28:38.315 --> 28:39.520
Listen to me first, Dad.

303
28:40.235 --> 28:42.040
No, I'm okay now. I'm safe.

304
28:43.526 --> 28:44.800
Dad, listen.

305
28:46.100 --> 28:47.250
Please listen to me first.

306
28:47.800 --> 28:50.040
I haven't done anything. Really, I haven't done anything!

307
28:50.050 --> 28:51.920
And I'm safe now. I'm okay.

308
28:52.000 --> 28:53.001
Okay.

309
29:06.744 --> 29:09.920
If you find Hattha and her family, kill them all.

310
29:35.000 --> 29:36.301
[Areeya]

311
29:51.507 --> 29:53.859
- Can you help me? - I've got Master Tim's address. Write it down.

312
29:53.910 --> 29:55.700
Okay, okay. Hold on a second.

313
30:36.700 --> 30:38.160
What's wrong with Master Tim's feet, Dad?

314
30:38.592 --> 30:39.640
You're still on about that?

315
30:40.064 --> 30:42.065
Master Tim is not someone you should mess with.

316
30:43.483 --> 30:44.614
Stay away from him.

317
31:27.107 --> 31:28.108
Hey.

318
31:45.598 --> 31:46.599
Hattha.

319
31:47.500 --> 31:48.501
Hattha!

320
32:12.800 --> 32:14.701
[Master Tim's House, 95 Ratchadaphisek Road, Soi 95]

321
32:26.275 --> 32:27.560
- Master. - Go inside.

322
32:30.276 --> 32:31.440
- Master, please. - Just get in.

323
33:36.755 --> 33:37.756
Get inside.

324
33:56.814 --> 33:58.000
You screwed up, you know that?

325
33:58.478 --> 34:00.800
You went through all that trouble to find them, and then you let them get away!

326
34:01.224 --> 34:03.443
I won't do it again.

327
34:03.752 --> 34:04.753
Get up here.

328
34:07.208 --> 34:08.209
Get up here!

329
34:11.560 --> 34:12.561
Where do you think you're going?

330
34:27.043 --> 34:28.720
That hurts, Master!

331
34:31.816 --> 34:32.840
You're going to hurt a lot more than that.

332
34:44.563 --> 34:46.160
A lot more!

333
35:49.040 --> 35:50.280
Master Tim doesn't have flat feet.

334
36:41.715 --> 36:42.716
Give me the bag.

335
36:46.550 --> 36:47.551
Want some water?

336
36:54.368 --> 36:56.369
Hattha, what's wrong?

337
36:56.900 --> 36:59.040
Hattha, take it easy.

338
37:04.126 --> 37:05.127
Feeling better?

339
37:08.523 --> 37:09.640
Calm down. Calm down.

340
37:25.443 --> 37:27.520
Is this why Dad didn't want us getting involved with Master Tim?

341
37:30.323 --> 37:32.040
Because he's really scary.

342
37:35.955 --> 37:37.600
Then why did you go to Master Tim's house?

343
37:43.766 --> 37:45.400
I wanted to know if he had flat feet.

344
37:48.715 --> 37:50.203
He's the one who killed my mom that day,

345
37:52.880 --> 37:53.881
that flatfooted bastard!

346
37:59.000 --> 38:00.120
You're the flatfooted bastard!

347
38:01.216 --> 38:03.120
Mom! Mom!

348
38:15.363 --> 38:16.480
This is serious, you know.

349
38:20.446 --> 38:21.447
Hang in there, okay?

350
38:41.032 --> 38:42.595
This is grown-up business. Go to bed.

351
39:08.381 --> 39:09.382
Follow me.

352
39:36.300 --> 39:38.523
When I was a kid, I lived with my mom in Bangkok.

353
39:41.574 --> 39:44.448
One day, she took me to Phuket to surprise my dad.

354
39:46.400 --> 39:48.320
But that was the day I found out

355
39:49.088 --> 39:51.115
my dad had another family there.

356
39:54.923 --> 39:56.700
He had another son with his wife.

357
40:07.125 --> 40:10.920
After that, I went to the beach and cried.

358
40:15.360 --> 40:17.280
Then, out of nowhere, a little girl

359
40:18.997 --> 40:20.040
came up to me.

360
40:22.896 --> 40:23.897
Phuket?

361
40:36.707 --> 40:39.640
Hey, have you seen my money? It blew this way.

362
40:41.416 --> 40:43.064
Have you seen my money?

363
40:43.110 --> 40:44.111
No.

364
40:44.846 --> 40:47.720
Are you crying? What's wrong? Are you sick?

365
40:47.926 --> 40:50.000
I have a headache. Leave me alone.

366
40:58.499 --> 40:59.520
Feeling better?

367
41:02.344 --> 41:04.040
This is my dad's shop. You can go there.

368
41:24.963 --> 41:26.140
How long have you known?

369
41:28.000 --> 41:30.667
Since I saw you and your dad giving massages to elderly people at the temple.

370
41:32.624 --> 41:35.120
He told me your dad used to run a massage shop in Phuket.

371
41:39.765 --> 41:42.800
I can't believe that little girl grew up to be you.

372
41:44.805 --> 41:46.960
And that little boy grew up to be a hitman?

373
41:53.136 --> 41:55.050
We both have painful pasts.

374
41:55.803 --> 41:57.720
It's too late for me to turn my life around.

375
41:59.670 --> 42:01.250
But you can still stop now.

376
42:02.950 --> 42:06.520
Give up on revenge. Stop looking for that flatfooted bastard.

377
42:07.584 --> 42:09.560
And go back to living your life with your dad.

378
42:19.827 --> 42:22.360
I don't want the hands that gave me a massage that day

379
42:23.859 --> 42:24.960
to end up covered in blood

380
42:27.240 --> 42:28.241
like mine.

381
42:36.542 --> 42:37.880
You did all this

382
42:39.838 --> 42:41.640
just because I was that little girl?

383
42:47.358 --> 42:48.840
After I met you that day,

384
42:52.024 --> 42:53.025
the next day,

385
42:54.531 --> 42:56.160
my mom died in a car accident.

386
43:00.643 --> 43:02.766
My dad sent me to live with my uncle, who was a hitman.

387
43:06.184 --> 43:07.848
My life changed forever that day.

388
43:12.246 --> 43:14.651
You were the last bit of happiness in my life.

389
44:32.758 --> 44:33.759
Let's go.

390
44:34.758 --> 44:35.920
- Phat? - Let's go.

391
44:36.576 --> 44:37.577
- Just go. - Phat?

392
44:40.341 --> 44:41.720
- Hey, kiddo. - Wan?

393
44:43.814 --> 44:45.755
Thank you for letting me know.

394
44:49.440 --> 44:50.841
Go home with your brother.

395
44:52.363 --> 44:54.040
Live a happy life with your father.

396
44:55.200 --> 44:56.201
For me, too.

397
44:58.390 --> 44:59.391
Come on, let's go.

398
44:59.664 --> 45:01.040
- Phat? - Let's go.

399
45:05.099 --> 45:06.100
Phat?

400
45:49.843 --> 45:50.960
He did the right thing.

401
45:52.190 --> 45:53.500
I think he cares about you.

402
46:18.400 --> 46:19.401
Wan!

403
46:24.571 --> 46:25.880
- What is it? - That is Mr. Krit.

404
46:30.470 --> 46:31.920
I know who can help us.

405
46:35.902 --> 46:37.300
Hey! Wait.

406
46:40.531 --> 46:42.400
Hello, I…

407
46:42.430 --> 46:44.720
Do you

408
46:45.000 --> 46:46.120
I have no idea.

409
46:46.800 --> 46:47.801
I'm sorry.

410
47:27.872 --> 47:28.873
I've got a keycard, sir.

411
47:57.766 --> 47:59.250
Sir? This way.

412
48:08.422 --> 48:09.686
Go catch him downstairs! Go!

413
48:09.787 --> 48:10.788
Got it, sir.

414
48:23.419 --> 48:24.420
Hey!

415
48:30.952 --> 48:31.953
No.

416
48:32.878 --> 48:34.715
Please, please.

417
48:35.475 --> 48:37.776
Please help me. I need to see where Mr. Krit was heading to.

418
48:37.800 --> 48:39.560
I have something important to talk to him.

419
48:39.870 --> 48:41.080
You're asking me to break the rules.

420
48:41.454 --> 48:42.760
Nobody will find out about it.

421
48:43.539 --> 48:46.250
Do you like massages? I'm really good at them. I'll give you one for free!

422
49:03.262 --> 49:04.263
Hey!

423
49:06.063 --> 49:07.664
Are you going to shoot me?

424
49:09.251 --> 49:10.344
Do you want to shoot me?

425
49:47.046 --> 49:48.047
11…

426
49:48.384 --> 49:49.385
12…

427
49:49.800 --> 49:50.801
13…

428
49:51.320 --> 49:52.321
14…

429
49:52.800 --> 49:53.801
15…

430
50:17.496 --> 50:19.320
Let me go, damn it!

431
50:28.480 --> 50:30.280
Flatfoot insoles?

432
50:32.064 --> 50:33.400
Lord Krit uses these too?

433
50:59.568 --> 51:00.760
Mr. Krit has flat feet?

434
51:17.337 --> 51:19.338
Why did Mr. Krit hurt you?

435
51:20.080 --> 51:22.800
I want to know if Mr. Krit is the flatfooted bastard who killed my mother.

436
51:23.400 --> 51:24.920
Stop looking for that flatfooted bastard.

437
51:26.320 --> 51:28.500
Anyway, what brings you all the way to my house today?

438
51:29.080 --> 51:30.760
Is there something you need?

439
51:31.120 --> 51:32.440
Let's talk in my office.
